    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Per-device resume path",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "```text\nDevice A closes mid-response\n  -> durable ThreadEvents continue committing\n  -> Device B authenticates and sends its last ThreadCursor\n  -> bounded replay starts after that ThreadPosition\n  -> replay-to-live cut preserves order\n  -> Devices B, C, and D independently advance their own cursors\n  -> every projection converges on canonical PostgreSQL history\n```",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    },
